{
 "_about": "Section 4 of the launch page, built by docs/launch_20261116/tools/build_familiarity_anonymity_data.py from the paper only. Strings are paper text (src gives the file); `probe` quotes the familiarity prompt file verbatim (not in the paper); `ui` lists control and chart words, `demo` the demo's own words and `notes_ours` our words in the footnotes. Numbers carry the paper file they come from.",
